---

# 3. Admin Authentication Flow

The system uses:

```txt
JWT Token Authentication
```

Authentication flow:

```txt
1. Admin logs in
2. Backend returns JWT token
3. Frontend stores token in localStorage
4. Protected admin pages verify token
5. API requests attach Authorization header
```

Example:

```txt
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

---

# 4. Admin Layout Protection

The admin layout uses:

```txt
useEffect authentication checking
```

Logic flow:

```txt
1. User enters admin page
2. Frontend checks localStorage token
3. If token is missing
4. Redirect to /admin/login
```

Example:

```ts
const token = localStorage.getItem("adminToken");

if (!token) {
  router.push("/admin/login");
}
```

Purpose:

```txt
✅ Prevent unauthorized frontend access
✅ Protect admin pages
✅ Improve admin security flow
```

